  - m_Id: 36026415308800
    m_Localized: Build the network core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308801
    m_Localized: Stand on the marked pad until the circle fills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308802
    m_Localized: Confirm construction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308803
    m_Localized: Build the core to unlock the other building pads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308804
    m_Localized: Mine or turret?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308805
    m_Localized: A mine earns credits after the wave. A turret protects the core
      immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308806
    m_Localized: Confirm construction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36026415308807
